Financial Reports</a><a href="#" class="block border-b border-white/10 last:border-b-0 py-[12px] font-medium text-[18px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white/60" style="padding-left:16px">Group Meeting</a><a href="#" class="block border-b border-white/10 last:border-b-0 py-[12px] font-medium text-[18px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white/60" style="padding-left:16px">Investor Meet 2024</a><a href="#" class="block border-b border-white/10 last:border-b-0 py-[12px] font-medium text-[18px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white/60" style="padding-left:16px">Offer Documents</a><a href="#" class="block border-b border-white/10 last:border-b-0 py-[12px] font-medium text-[18px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white/60" style="padding-left:16px">Investors Helpdesk</a><a href="#" class="block border-b border-white/10 last:border-b-0 py-[12px] font-medium text-[18px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white/60" style="padding-left: 16px;">Disclosures under Regulation 46 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015</a></div></details><details class="border-b border-white/10 last:border-b-0"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between py-[14px] cursor-pointer"><span class="font-medium text-[22px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.88px] text-white/70">Sustainability</span><span class="shrink-0 ml-3 text-white/60"><span data-fallback-plus="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class=""><path d="M5 12H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M12 5V19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><span data-fallback-minus="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class=""><path d="M5 12H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span></span></summary><div class="pb-2"><a href="#" class="block border-b border-white/10 last:border-b-0 py-[12px] font-medium text-[18px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white/60" style="padding-left:16px">Overview</a></div></details><details class="border-b border-white/10 last:border-b-0"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between py-[14px] cursor-pointer"><span class="font-medium text-[22px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.88px] text-white/70">Media</span><span class="shrink-0 ml-3 text-white/60"><span data-fallback-plus="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class=""><path d="M5 12H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M12 5V19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><span data-fallback-minus="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class=""><path d="M5 12H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span></span></summary><div class="pb-2"><a href="#" class="block py-[12px] pl-4 font-medium text-[18px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white/60">Press Releases</a><a href="#" class="block py-[12px] pl-4 font-medium text-[18px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white/60">In the news</a><a href="#" class="block py-[12px] pl-4 font-medium text-[18px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white/60">Media Kit</a><a href="#" class="block py-[12px] pl-4 font-medium text-[18px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white/60">Photo Gallery</a><a href="#" class="block py-[12px] pl-4 font-medium text-[18px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white/60">Video Gallery</a></div></details><a href="#" class="border-b border-white/10 last:border-b-0 py-[14px] font-medium text-[22px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.88px] text-white/70">Careers</a><a href="#" class="border-b border-white/10 last:border-b-0 py-[14px] font-medium text-[22px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.88px] text-white/70">Contact Us</a></nav></div></div><main><div class="relative w-full"><section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-humble-beige block leading-[0]"><div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 grid-rows-1 h-[clamp(320px,177.8vw,761px)] md:h-[clamp(432px,56.25vw,1080px)]"><div class="col-span-full row-span-full relative min-h-0 h-full w-full overflow-hidden"><picture><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="/assets-f/img/8f0f22f5e0f903.jpg"><img src="/assets-f/img/bef624f94eeacd.jpg" alt="Suzlon wind turbine nacelle aerial view over green fields" class="absolute inset-0 block h-full w-full object-cover object-[50%_75%] sm:object-[50%_65%] md:inset-auto md:top-[-0.96%] md:left-[-7.82%] md:h-[64.61%] md:w-[108.55%] md:max-w-none" sizes="100vw" decoding="async"></picture></div></div></section><div class="relative z-10 -mt-12 sm:-mt-20 lg:-mt-[100px] xl:-mt-[200px] min-[1440px]:-mt-[310px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-tl-[16px] rounded-tr-[16px] bg-humble-beige"><section class="pb-16 pt-10 md:pb-20 md:pt-16 lg:pb-[clamp(96px,10vw,160px)]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-10 min-[1440px]:px-[40px] flex flex-col gap-10 min-[1440px]:gap-14"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 whitespace-normal sm:whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-[10px] leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.2px]"><a class="shrink-0 transition-colors duration-200 text-ever-teal-100 hover:text-ever-teal-80" href="#">Home</a><span class="shrink-0 text-dark-2/40" aria-hidden="true">/</span><a class="shrink-0 transition-colors duration-200 text-dark-2 hover:text-dark-1" href="#">Our Businesses</a><span class="shrink-0 text-dark-2/40" aria-hidden="true">/</span><a class="shrink-0 transition-colors duration-200 text-dark-2 hover:text-dark-1" href="#">Products</a><span class="shrink-0 text-dark-2/40" aria-hidden="true">/</span><span class="text-dark-2 min-w-0 truncate" title="Wind">Wind</span></nav><div class="flex max-w-[780px] flex-col gap-6"><h1 class="font-bold text-ever-teal-100 text-[42px] leading-[48px] tracking-[-2.4px] md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-3px] lg:text-[80px] lg:leading-[86px] lg:tracking-[-4.8px]">Built with intelligence from 10,000+ global wind turbines</h1><p class="font-normal text-dark-2 text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.36px] md:text-[20px] md:tracking-[-0.4px]">Make your site work with wind platforms designed around real-world conditions. Across terrains, wind regimes and operating realities, our turbines are made with three decades of R&amp;D and manufacturing expertise. Assured performance, always.</p></div></div></section></div></div><section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden min-h-[720px] md:min-h-[900px] xl:min-h-[1251px]" aria-label="Wind 2.0 – because the energy transition needs wind that’s smarter"><div class="absolute inset-0"><video class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center" autoplay="" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" preload="auto" poster="/assets-f/img/b36f384a6cd630.jpg"><source src="/assets-f/media/4534cb6d9dbdf4.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/50" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-10 min-[1440px]:px-[40px] flex flex-col items-start gap-12 py-16 md:py-20 lg:py-[clamp(96px,10vw,160px)]"><h2 class="max-w-[785px] font-semibold text-[36px] leading-[42px] tracking-[-1.44px] text-white md:text-[48px] md:leading-[54px] lg:text-[56px] lg:leading-[62px] lg:tracking-[-2.24px]"><span class="block">Wind 2.0 – because the energy</span><span class="block">transition needs wind that’s smarter</span></h2><div class="flex w-full max-w-[1130px] flex-col items-end gap-12 lg:gap-[72px]"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-10 lg:gap-[86px]"><p class="max-w-[785px] font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white md:text-[22px] md:leading-[28px] md:tracking-[-0.88px]">Wind 2.0 moves wind energy beyond turbines. It connects advanced platforms, digital intelligence, hybrid systems, storage, and grid-smart controls into one ecosystem. Fewer, more efficient turbines that give you more output, better reliability. Built for firm, flexible, and predictable clean energy. This is the future of wind.</p><hr class="w-full border-0 border-t border-white/40"></div><ul class="grid w-full max-w-[680px] grid-cols-1 gap-x-10 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-x-16 sm:gap-y-8"><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-bold-amber pb-6 lg:gap-4 lg:pb-[24px]"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[30px] tracking-[-0.96px] text-white md:text-[30px] md:leading-[36px] md:tracking-[-1.2px]"><span class="block">Terrain and wind </span><span class="block">diversity</span></h3><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-white md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] md:tracking-[-0.32px]">Every site has different wind behaviour, terrain, logistics, and grid conditions. Platforms must perform for your operational realities.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-bold-amber pb-6 lg:gap-4 lg:pb-[24px]"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[30px] tracking-[-0.96px] text-white md:text-[30px] md:leading-[36px] md:tracking-[-1.2px]">Better Output</h3><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-white md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] md:tracking-[-0.32px]">Turbines must deliver more, higher-quality energy to support uninterrupted operations in an ever-evolving energy world.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-bold-amber pb-6 lg:gap-4 lg:pb-[24px]"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[30px] tracking-[-0.96px] text-white md:text-[30px] md:leading-[36px] md:tracking-[-1.2px]">Lifecycle continuity</h3><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-white md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] md:tracking-[-0.32px]">Turbines need to stay productive to offer you the best performance value for your operational goals and commercial priorities.</p></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="bg-humble-beige"><div class="flex flex-col items-center pt-16 md:pt-20 min-[1440px]:pt-[160px]"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-14 min-[1440px]:gap-[56px]"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-12 min-[1440px]:gap-[48px]"><header class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1120px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6 break-words px-5 text-center md:px-[30px] lg:px-10 min-[1440px]:gap-6 min-[1440px]:px-0"><h2 class="w-full shrink-0 font-bold text-[36px] leading-[42px] tracking-[-2.16px] text-ever-teal-100 md:text-[52px] md:leading-[58px] min-[1440px]:text-[66px] min-[1440px]:leading-[72px] min-[1440px]:tracking-[-3.96px]">Wind platforms designed<br aria-hidden="true">for the next generation of energy</h2><div class="w-full shrink-0 whitespace-pre-wrap font-normal leading-[0] text-[18px] tracking-[-0.36px] text-dark-2 min-[1440px]:text-[20px] min-[1440px]:tracking-[-0.4px]"><p class="leading-[28px] mb-0">We’ve spent decades advancing wind technology through continuous engineering, field learning, and innovation. </p><p class="leading-[28px] mb-0">The result? Intelligent turbine platforms that perform across geographies and wind regimes. Backed by in-house</p><p class="leading-[28px] mb-0">R&amp;D and end-to-end manufacturing expertise. Ready to integrate into full-stack renewable energy</p><p class="leading-[28px] ">ecosystems to give you dependable power.</p></div></header><div class="w-full overflow-hidden pb-4"><div class="embla-viewport w-full min-w-0 overflow-hidden [container-type:inline-size] cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-pan-x [-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch]" data-embla-carousel="true"><ul class="flex list-none items-stretch gap-5 min-[1440px]:gap-5 px-4 sm:px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-10 xl:px-24 min-[1440px]:pl-[40px] min-[1440px]:pr-[155px]" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);"><li class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 w-[min(85vw,555px)]"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6"><div class="relative h-[min(62vw,370px)] w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden media-carousel-image-cut min-[1440px]:h-[370px] min-[1440px]:w-[555px]"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[30px] tracking-[-0.96px] text-dark-1 md:text-[30px] md:leading-[36px] md:tracking-[-1.2px]">Built for terrain and wind diversity</h3><div class="text-dark-2"><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[20px] tracking-[-0.28px]">No two wind sites are the same. That’s why our platforms are defined by a deep understanding of varied wind regimes, terrain conditions, and project environments. Whether low, moderate or high wind speeds, we make it work for your operations.</p><p class="mt-0 font-bold text-[14px] leading-[20px] tracking-[-0.28px]">Wind regime matching | IEC class fit | Site-specific selection | Terrain-adapted platforms</p></div></div></div></li><li class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 w-[min(85vw,555px)]"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6"><div class="relative h-[min(62vw,370px)] w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden media-carousel-image-cut min-[1440px]:h-[370px] min-[1440px]:w-[555px]"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[30px] tracking-[-0.96px] text-dark-1 md:text-[30px] md:leading-[36px] md:tracking-[-1.2px]">Customised component by component</h3><div class="text-dark-2"><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[20px] tracking-[-0.28px]">In-house R&amp;D and manufacturing make up the core of our nacelles, towers, blades, hubs, and electrical systems. Every component is engineered to support better yield, output, and product life.</p><p class="mt-0 font-bold text-[14px] leading-[20px] tracking-[-0.28px]">Hybrid Lattice Tower | Advanced blade materials | In-house manufacturing | Good make</p></div></div></div></li><li class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 w-[min(85vw,555px)]"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6"><div class="relative h-[min(62vw,370px)] w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden media-carousel-image-cut min-[1440px]:h-[370px] min-[1440px]:w-[555px]"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[30px] tracking-[-0.96px] text-dark-1 md:text-[30px] md:leading-[36px] md:tracking-[-1.2px]">Lifecycle continuity</h3><div class="text-dark-2"><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[20px] tracking-[-0.28px]">Our tech’s reliability comes from wind intelligence gathered through decades of operating experience. Lifetime maintenance, predictive intelligence, SCADA monitoring, and multi-brand expertise ensure your wind assets perform consistently throughout their full lifecycle.</p><p class="mt-0 font-bold text-[14px] leading-[20px] tracking-[-0.28px]">OMS support | Predictive intelligence | SCADA monitoring | Multi-brand expertise</p></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-10 px-5 py-16 md:gap-16 md:px-[30px] md:py-20 lg:px-10 min-[1440px]:flex-row min-[1440px]:gap-16 min-[1440px]:px-[40px] min-[1440px]:py-[160px]"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-10 sm:flex-row sm:gap-16 min-[1440px]:gap-16"><article class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4 border-b border-dark-2 pb-6"><p class="font-normal text-[40px] leading-[46px] tracking-[-1.6px] text-ever-teal-100 md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px]">21,700+</p><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-dark-2 md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] md:tracking-[-0.32px]"><span class="block">MW good </span><span class="block">energies installed</span></p></article><article class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4 border-b border-dark-2 pb-6"><p class="font-normal text-[40px] leading-[46px] tracking-[-1.6px] text-ever-teal-100 md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px]">10,000+</p><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-dark-2 md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] md:tracking-[-0.32px]"><span class="block">Assets operating</span><span class="block">worldwide</span></p></article></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-10 sm:flex-row sm:gap-16 min-[1440px]:gap-16"><article class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4 border-b border-dark-2 pb-6"><p class="font-normal text-[40px] leading-[46px] tracking-[-1.6px] text-ever-teal-100 md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px]">1,900+</p><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-dark-2 md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] md:tracking-[-0.32px]"><span class="block">Good relationships</span><span class="block">across sectors</span></p></article><article class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4 border-b border-dark-2 pb-6"><p class="font-normal text-[40px] leading-[46px] tracking-[-1.6px] text-ever-teal-100 md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px]">20+</p><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-dark-2 md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] md:tracking-[-0.32px]"><span class="block">Years product</span><span class="block">lifecycle</span></p></article></div></div></div></section><section id="platforms"><section id="systems" class="bg-ever-teal-100 py-16 md:py-20 lg:py-[clamp(96px,10vw,160px)]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-10 min-[1440px]:px-[40px] flex flex-col gap-20"><header class="border-b border-humble-beige pb-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><h2 class="font-semibold text-[36px] leading-[42px] tracking-[-2.16px] text-humble-beige md:text-[52px] md:leading-[58px] lg:text-[66px] lg:leading-[72px] lg:tracking-[-3.96px]">Four platforms for every wind regime</h2><p class="max-w-[1120px] font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.36px] text-white md:text-[20px] md:tracking-[-0.4px]">Our modular platforms cover a spectrum of wind speeds, site conditions, and performance ambitions. Find the platform series made for your needs.</p></div></header><ul class="flex flex-col gap-16 min-[1000px]:gap-20"><li class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-10 min-[1000px]:grid-cols-[minmax(160px,280px)_minmax(140px,220px)_minmax(0,1fr)] min-[1000px]:items-start min-[1000px]:gap-x-10 min-[1000px]:gap-y-0 xl:grid-cols-[400px_300px_minmax(0,1fr)] xl:gap-x-20"><div class="integrated-solutions-row-image-cut relative h-[min(70vh,400px)] w-full max-w-[400px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden min-[1000px]:h-[min(42vw,480px)] min-[1000px]:max-w-[280px] xl:h-[533px] xl:max-w-[400px] xl:w-[400px]"></div><div class="flex w-full max-w-[300px] shrink-0 flex-col gap-6"><div class="border-b border-bold-amber pb-6"><p class="font-semibold text-[32px] leading-[38px] tracking-[-1.28px] text-humble-beige md:text-[40px] md:leading-[46px] md:tracking-[-1.6px]"><span class="block">Blue Sky</span><span class="block">S163</span></p></div><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[20px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-white">6.x MW Platform</p></div><article class="flex min-w-0 w-full flex-col gap-8 min-[1000px]:max-w-none"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 text-white"><p class="font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.36px] md:text-[20px] md:tracking-[-0.4px]">The S163 adapts to moderate-to-high wind sites to deliver higher output while maintaining a lower levelised cost of energy. This platform is made for scale and high performance.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p class="font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[30px] tracking-[-0.96px] md:text-[30px] md:leading-[36px] md:tracking-[-1.2px]">Highlights:</p><ul class="list-disc space-y-4 pl-[30px] marker:text-white"><li class="font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.36px] md:text-[20px] md:tracking-[-0.4px]">Available in up to 150m hub heights</li><li class="font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.36px] md:text-[20px] md:tracking-[-0.4px]">Moderate to high winds</li><li class="font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.36px] md:text-[20px] md:tracking-[-0.4px]">Modular for site-adaptability</li></ul></div></div><a class="group/viewall flex gap-[4px] items-center relative shrink-0 w-fit" href="#"><div class="flex items-center justif