in-[1440px]:pt-[160px]"><header class="relative z-[3] flex max-w-[495px] flex-col gap-8 min-[1440px]:mt-[60px] min-[1440px]:min-h-[611px] min-[1440px]:justify-between min-[1440px]:gap-0"><h2 class="font-semibold text-[36px] leading-[42px] tracking-[-1.44px] text-ever-teal-100 md:text-[48px] md:leading-[54px] lg:text-[56px] lg:leading-[62px] lg:tracking-[-2.24px]">Three decades of wind technology evolution</h2><p class="font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.36px] text-dark-2 md:text-[20px] md:tracking-[-0.4px] min-[1440px]:max-w-[495px]">Our wind turbine generators have evolved from early platforms to bigger, stronger machines that deliver more with each rotation. The perfect blend of global R&amp;D and value engineering ensures our turbines offer you high returns across geographies.</p></header><figure class="relative z-[4] mx-auto aspect-[745/732] w-full max-w-[745px] min-[1440px]:mx-0 min-[1440px]:h-[732px] min-[1440px]:w-[745px]"></figure></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate min-h-[560px] overflow-hidden lg:h-[900px] lg:min-h-[900px]"><div class="absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute left-0 top-[-18.56%] h-[118.53%] w-full"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30"></div></div><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-10 min-[1440px]:px-[40px] grid h-full min-h-[inherit] grid-cols-1 gap-12 py-16 md:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,575px)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:items-end lg:gap-16 lg:py-[clamp(96px,10vw,160px)]"><header class="flex max-w-[575px] flex-col gap-6 text-white"><h2 class="font-bold text-[32px] leading-[38px] tracking-[-1.28px] min-[1440px]:text-[40px] min-[1440px]:leading-[46px] min-[1440px]:tracking-[-1.6px]">Global in-house R&amp;D. Three decades of wind intelligence</h2><p class="font-semibold text-[16px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.32px]">R&amp;D ecosystem built to continuously improve turbine performance, reliability, and energy output for real-world conditions. Whether aerodynamics, blade design, drivetrain systems, low-carbon materials, or digital technologies. We make it all happen in-house in our global R&amp;D centres across Germany, Denmark, the Netherlands, and India. Backed by advanced testing, simulation, and field intelligence, we optimise generation and improve lifecycle performance. Accelerating the energy transition for diverse terrains and wind regimes.</p></header><ul class="list-disc space-y-6 ps-8 marker:text-white lg:max-w-[440px] lg:justify-self-end lg:border-l-[0.5px] lg:border-solid lg:border-white lg:pl-5"><li class="ps-2 font-semibold text-[20px] leading-[26px] tracking-[-0.8px] text-white lg:ms-[30px] lg:ps-0">8 R&amp;D Centres</li><li class="ps-2 font-semibold text-[20px] leading-[26px] tracking-[-0.8px] text-white lg:ms-[30px] lg:ps-0">DK · DE · NL · IN Locations</li><li class="ps-2 font-semibold text-[20px] leading-[26px] tracking-[-0.8px] text-white lg:ms-[30px] lg:ps-0">3 decades continuous engineering iteration</li></ul></div></section><section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden min-h-[640px] md:min-h-[760px] xl:min-h-[863px]" aria-label="Good make for better energy delivery"><div class="absolute inset-0"><video class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center" autoplay="" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" preload="auto" poster="/assets-f/img/ebdef8286cd4ac.jpg"><source src="/assets-f/media/6c0bdb545701fe.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/50" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-10 min-[1440px]:px-[40px] flex flex-col items-start gap-12 py-16 md:py-20 lg:py-[clamp(96px,10vw,160px)]"><h2 class="max-w-[785px] font-semibold text-[36px] leading-[42px] tracking-[-1.44px] text-white md:text-[48px] md:leading-[54px] lg:text-[56px] lg:leading-[62px] lg:tracking-[-2.24px]"><span class="block">Good make for</span><span class="block">better energy delivery</span></h2><div class="flex w-full max-w-[1130px] flex-col items-end gap-12 lg:gap-[72px]"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-10 lg:gap-[86px]"><p class="max-w-[785px] font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white md:text-[22px] md:leading-[28px] md:tracking-[-0.88px]">Fast, integrated, and built for consistency. We produce key turbine components: blades, nacelles, towers, hubs, and control systems. With a vertically integrated manufacturing ecosystem, backed by advanced quality systems and large-scale production capabilities, we manufacture for reliability and high performance in the modern energy markets.</p><hr class="w-full border-0 border-t border-white/40"></div><ul class="grid w-full max-w-[680px] grid-cols-1 gap-x-10 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-x-16 sm:gap-y-8"><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-bold-amber pb-6 lg:gap-4 lg:pb-[24px]"><h3 class="font-normal text-[40px] leading-[46px] tracking-[-1.6px] text-white md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px]">4,500 MW</h3><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-white md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] md:tracking-[-0.32px]">Annual Domestic Capacity</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-bold-amber pb-6 lg:gap-4 lg:pb-[24px]"><h3 class="font-normal text-[40px] leading-[46px] tracking-[-1.6px] text-white md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px]">15</h3><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-white md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] md:tracking-[-0.32px]">Manufacturing Facilities</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-bold-amber pb-6 lg:gap-4 lg:pb-[24px]"><h3 class="font-normal text-[40px] leading-[46px] tracking-[-1.6px] text-white md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px]">100%</h3><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-white md:text-[16px] md:leading-[24px] md:tracking-[-0.32px]">Vertically Integrated</p></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="bg-humble-beige py-16 md:py-20 lg:py-[clamp(96px,10vw,160px)]"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-14 min-[1440px]:gap-[56px]"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-12 min-[1440px]:gap-[48px]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-10 min-[1440px]:px-[40px]"><h2 class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1120px] text-center font-bold text-[36px] leading-[42px] tracking-[-2.16px] text-ever-teal-100 md:text-[52px] md:leading-[58px] lg:text-[66px] lg:leading-[72px] lg:tracking-[-3.96px]">Explore Further</h2></div><div class="w-full overflow-hidden pb-4"><div class="embla-viewport w-full min-w-0 overflow-hidden [container-type:inline-size] cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-pan-x [-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch]" data-embla-carousel="true"><ul class="flex list-none items-stretch gap-5 min-[1440px]:gap-5 px-4 sm:px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-10 xl:px-24 min-[1440px]:pl-[40px] min-[1440px]:pr-[155px]" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);"><li class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 w-[min(85vw,555px)]"><a class="group flex w-full flex-col gap-6 min-[1440px]:gap-6" href="#"><div class="relative h-[min(62vw,370px)] w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden media-carousel-image-cut min-[1440px]:h-[370px] min-[1440px]:w-[555px]"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 min-[1440px]:gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[30px] tracking-[-0.96px] text-dark-1 md:text-[30px] md:leading-[36px] md:tracking-[-1.2px]">Integrated Solutions</h3><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[20px] tracking-[-0.28px] text-dark-2">Wind, solar, storage, and execution — combined into end-to-end clean energy systems including storage, BESS, Full Stack RE, and Hybrid solutions.</p></div></a></li><li class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 w-[min(85vw,555px)]"><a class="group flex w-full flex-col gap-6 min-[1440px]:gap-6" href="#"><div class="relative h-[min(62vw,370px)] w-full shrink-0